5. Automation plane
Common bottlenecks
No availability of input data to complete reconciliation
Approver not approving reconciliation on time
Lack of response on time when Agent initiated discussion in Intercompany module
Lack of Explainability: Agent is not able to explain properly what is required to finalize the reconciliation.
Unpredictability and Reliability: it may take unexpected paths to solve problems, which can lead to inconsistent outcomes.


ESOAR
Eliminate: Manual investigation and explanation of Intercompany reconciling items
Standardize: communication between parties in the process; rules for error resolution
Optimize: time of reconciliation cycle by significantly decreasing time of reconciling items resolution and prioritization of high risk accounts in the reconciliation queue.
Automate: Communication in case of discussion using Intercompany module functionality in collaboration with Agent efforts
Reimagine: Agentic led Account IC Reconciliation preparation maximizing usage of Blackline Intercompany solution in collaboration with Agent efforts
